// Chupacabra model spawn test bed on Eden (Everon), daylight (10:00). One stock
// player only; tests/integration/scripting/cryptid_model_spawn spawns the
// UDChupacabra unit from script. addOns[] names the creature's addon: a
// runtime createUnit of a class whose owner addon is not activated is refused
// ("type is abstract"), and there is no script command to activate one.
